{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sagas of Lumin is a single-player, semi-open-world action RPG. Seamlessly switch between aerial and ground combat while forming a unique bond with your dragon and unleashing devastation on your enemies. Explore this magical world with your dragon, and once on the ground, choose between swords, firearms, or magic to decide how you will fight your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/774b5817fb9fcf974e3c15918224844e.avif?t=1773506967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras_big/774b5817fb9fcf974e3c15918224844e.webp?t=1773506967 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/fc5e77cce2c942e12ee3d973863692af.poster.avif?t=1773506967\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/fc5e77cce2c942e12ee3d973863692af.webm?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/fc5e77cce2c942e12ee3d973863692af.mp4?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your dragon and claim the skies. Soar freely, climb towering heights, dive through the clouds, and hover above the battlefield as you rain fire upon your enemies. When they dare come close, unleash your claws, crushing tackles, and savage bites. In real-time aerial combat, challenge rival dragons, lay waste to enemy bases, and clash with powerful airships but never forget to evade the deadly attacks coming your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/d5fa1689ecbdd4860609a3dd646c3a06.avif?t=1773506967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras_big/d5fa1689ecbdd4860609a3dd646c3a06.webp?t=1773506967 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd64294491a092f2faa56bf5c0b48f2b.poster.avif?t=1773506967\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd64294491a092f2faa56bf5c0b48f2b.webm?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd64294491a092f2faa56bf5c0b48f2b.mp4?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Lumin is like a treasure waiting to be discovered. Mount your dragon and explore its regions one by one, uncovering items that will strengthen both you and your dragon. Of course, you\u2019ll also need to face the dangers of this world. Raid enemy camps or overcome challenging trials to earn the rewards you seek.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/6f406a55bcb9967d0daef8f5d85b4508.avif?t=1773506967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras_big/6f406a55bcb9967d0daef8f5d85b4508.webp?t=1773506967 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd47cc86b41708e5ce9d488f6cf96f0d.poster.avif?t=1773506967\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd47cc86b41708e5ce9d488f6cf96f0d.webm?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd47cc86b41708e5ce9d488f6cf96f0d.mp4?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019re on the ground, your most trusted ally may not always be by your side, so as a Drair, you must handle your own battles. In Sagas of Lumin, melee combat is built around timing and precision. You can strike your enemies with swords, axes, and spears, while also blocking and parrying their attacks. Use your steampunk firearms to shoot from a distance or unleash your magic. Get ready to experience a freedom on the ground that mirrors the thrill of aerial combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/eea603f002a2a3a8a545a9eef17a56a1.avif?t=1773506967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras_big/eea603f002a2a3a8a545a9eef17a56a1.webp?t=1773506967 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sagas of Lumin offers a deep story where your choices change the outcome. The world is morally comlex and avoids clich\u00e9 good-versus-evil narratives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3130220?t=1773506967","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/88a04ed0c6d352c832c28ad0a52c466df8d1c04e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773506967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/020ac5c6f01f4caf468b4e2d934ffc9d9f8efc61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773506967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/020ac5c6f01f4caf468b4e2d934ffc9d9f8efc61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773506967","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Sagas of Lumin features intense battles and warfare. Combat includes the use of swords, axes, and other melee weapons, as well as firearms. Blood is visible during these encounters, but no dismemberment occurs. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3717300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sagas of Lumin is a single-player, semi-open-world action RPG. Seamlessly switch between aerial and ground combat while forming a unique bond with your dragon and unleashing devastation on your enemies. Explore this magical world with your dragon, and once on the ground, choose between swords, firearms, or magic to decide how you will fight your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/774b5817fb9fcf974e3c15918224844e.avif?t=1773506967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras_big/774b5817fb9fcf974e3c15918224844e.webp?t=1773506967 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/fc5e77cce2c942e12ee3d973863692af.poster.avif?t=1773506967\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/fc5e77cce2c942e12ee3d973863692af.webm?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/fc5e77cce2c942e12ee3d973863692af.mp4?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your dragon and claim the skies. Soar freely, climb towering heights, dive through the clouds, and hover above the battlefield as you rain fire upon your enemies. When they dare come close, unleash your claws, crushing tackles, and savage bites. In real-time aerial combat, challenge rival dragons, lay waste to enemy bases, and clash with powerful airships but never forget to evade the deadly attacks coming your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/d5fa1689ecbdd4860609a3dd646c3a06.avif?t=1773506967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras_big/d5fa1689ecbdd4860609a3dd646c3a06.webp?t=1773506967 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd64294491a092f2faa56bf5c0b48f2b.poster.avif?t=1773506967\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd64294491a092f2faa56bf5c0b48f2b.webm?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd64294491a092f2faa56bf5c0b48f2b.mp4?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Lumin is like a treasure waiting to be discovered. Mount your dragon and explore its regions one by one, uncovering items that will strengthen both you and your dragon. Of course, you\u2019ll also need to face the dangers of this world. Raid enemy camps or overcome challenging trials to earn the rewards you seek.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/6f406a55bcb9967d0daef8f5d85b4508.avif?t=1773506967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras_big/6f406a55bcb9967d0daef8f5d85b4508.webp?t=1773506967 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd47cc86b41708e5ce9d488f6cf96f0d.poster.avif?t=1773506967\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd47cc86b41708e5ce9d488f6cf96f0d.webm?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/dd47cc86b41708e5ce9d488f6cf96f0d.mp4?t=1773506967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019re on the ground, your most trusted ally may not always be by your side, so as a Drair, you must handle your own battles. In Sagas of Lumin, melee combat is built around timing and precision. You can strike your enemies with swords, axes, and spears, while also blocking and parrying their attacks. Use your steampunk firearms to shoot from a distance or unleash your magic. Get ready to experience a freedom on the ground that mirrors the thrill of aerial combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras/eea603f002a2a3a8a545a9eef17a56a1.avif?t=1773506967\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/extras_big/eea603f002a2a3a8a545a9eef17a56a1.webp?t=1773506967 width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sagas of Lumin offers a deep story where your choices change the outcome. The world is morally comlex and avoids clich\u00e9 good-versus-evil narratives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Elos Games And Arts"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3130220/edd24b61ce2157f6a90199377527f32eceb986c3/header.jpg?t=1773506967","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Elos Games Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></